Output ./.github/assets/demo.gif
Require proton-vpn-tui

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1600
Set Height 1900

Type "proton-vpn-tui"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Down@800ms 3
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+F
Type "france"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1s
Left
Sleep 1s
Down@900ms 2
Enter
Sleep 5s
